    "synopsis": {
        "native": "Zeko, brivec in biv\u0161i vojak s PTSP-jem, povabi brata Bracota in prijatelja \u0160vabota na Bajram. Njegov plan je, da izkoristi dobro voljo ob prazniku in brata, ki je alkoholik in odvisnik od iger na sre\u010do, pregovori, da se spremeni. Braco ga ne jemlje resno in ga ne \u017eeli poslu\u0161ati. Zeko v roke vzame britev, jo prisloni Bracotu na vrat in na silo izterja njegovo zaobljubo da se bo spremenil. Braco odide jezen, z besedami, da lastnega brata ne \u017eeli nikoli ve\u010d videti, a \u0160vabo predlaga Zekotu, da si poi\u0161\u010de strokovno pomo\u010d. Ko ostane sam, brez brata in prijatelja, se Zeko odlo\u010di narediti samomor.",
        "english": "Zeko, a barber and a former fighter with PTSD, calls his brother Braco and his friend Svaba at Bajram. He intends to use the holiday mood and change his brother, gambler and alcoholics."
